	(lib_symbols)
	(text "CAPTURE PLAN\n\nJ100 Molex 5054482651, 26 positions\nPins 2/4: P4_5V; pins 5/6/16: GND\nFour UART pairs from measured ECN-0002 map\nPin 19: SYNC_MASTER; pin 10: CAM_PWR_EN\nPin 21: BTN_SHUTTER_N per ECN-0003\nPins 23/25: shared I2C\nPins 20/22/24/26: C6 service\n\nGPIO35 / PIN 15: DO NOT CONNECT.\n3.3 V pins are sense/service only; never back-power the Guition board."
